<div class="section-label jump-target" id="current-status">Current Status</div>
<h2>What Is Known Now</h2>

<p>The SR-177 Weber County extension segment from 1800 North to 4000 South is in the State Environmental Study phase.{% cite "udot-ses-schedule" %} UDOT has not published a preferred alignment or parcel-level right-of-way boundary as of April 2026.</p>

