<div class="task-grid">
  <div class="task-card">
    <div class="task-label">Study phase</div>
    <h3>Alternatives development</h3>
    <p>UDOT is evaluating the build alternative and expected to publish Draft State Environmental Study materials later in 2026.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="task-card">
    <div class="task-label">Funding</div>
    <h3>Construction unfunded</h3>
    <p>The official planning window remains Phase 3, 2043-2050, unless state or legislative funding priorities change.{% cite "wfrc-rtp-2023-2050" %}</p>
  </div>
  <div class="task-card">
    <div class="task-label">Alignment</div>
    <h3>No preferred alternative</h3>
    <p>Local officials have discussed a 5100 West corridor, but UDOT's formal alignment maps remain the controlling source once published.{% cite "whc-warnke-minutes" %}</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section-label jump-target" id="decision-points">Decision Points</div>
<h2>Where the Timeline Becomes Actionable</h2>

<p>The next major public milestone is the Draft State Environmental Study, expected in Fall 2026. That release should provide the first formal alignment maps for the Weber County segment and start a public comment period.{% cite "udot-ses-schedule" %}</p>

